This is the source material for the textbook *Theory of Computing*
by Jim Hefferon.   To get a PDF go to https://hefferon.net.

This source uses LaTeX and related programs.  To install the source
files, see INSTALL.


STATUS

This is a draft.  I used it for a class in the springs of 2018--2020,
and am using it in the spring of 2021.

I am currently compiling the answers to exercises and revising the text
body in preparation for version 1.0.  I am in the last chapter.  As in
any draft, expect errors.

The plan is to next supplement the text with programming exercises.
For this I had in mind using Racket or Scheme, but Python is
not impossible, inside of Juypter notebooks.


REPORTS

Bug reports very welcome.  The best way to reach me is via the Contact
link at https://hefferon.net


